score_now is the weighted mean of the same criteria as rounds 1-5 (C1, C2, C7, C10, C12, C13, C14, C18, C19, C20): 417.5 / 46 = 9.08. I report 9.0 because the sliced total sits on a routine path: 26-32% of orders are two pieces or more (FACTS), and 360x640 is the commonest screen. The critique is also written to /tmp/claude-0/-home-user/aaed4e78-f5ea-57f6-bb8a-ea8f2c0ecee0/scratchpad/pdp10/rounds/r6_art.json.

