fixes.change:
Put the bag's total in the fixed foot, never in the scrolling body.

1. L954: delete <div class="tt"><span>Total</span>' + R(s.total) + '</div>, so the ledger ends with 'Insured delivery, est. … Free'.

2. L969: replace the 'You save' line with:
'<div class="ft"><span>Total' + (s.r ? '<i> · you save ' + R(s.sub - s.total) + '</i>' : '') + '</span>' + R(s.total) + '</div>' +

3. L971: the button becomes <span>Secure checkout</span>' + UPI…. Drop <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>' + R(s.total), because the total now sits 50px above it in the same foot. If CRO wants the price kept on the button, keep it: steps 1, 2, 4 and 5 still hold (mockk/ shows that version).

4. CSS: delete L386-387 and L401-402, and add:
.dr-foot .ft { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; font-size: var(--t-body); }
.dr-foot .ft > .rs { font-size: var(--t-h2); line-height: 1.1; }
.dr-foot .ft i { font-style: normal; font-size: var(--t-small); color: var(--deep); }
.dr-foot .ft i .rs { font-size: var(--t-fig); }

5. L364: add -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(#000 calc(100% - 16px), transparent); mask-image: linear-gradient(#000 calc(100% - 16px), transparent);
Add a new rule: .dr-body > :last-child { margin-bottom: 16px; }
In fitPol (L979), compare with body.clientHeight - 16.

Measured on the copy (mock_bag.json, cmp_bag.jpg, cmp_bag4.jpg):
- The Total is whole for 1-4 pieces at 360x640, 320x568, 360x600, 390x664 and 412x732, in Cormorant 24 on the foot's first line, with 'you save ₹340' in deep sage beside 'Total'.
- With 2-4 pieces at 360x640 the foot is 482-640 (was 486). The body ends in a 16px fade instead of a hairline drawn across a line of text.
- A one-piece bag at 360x640 keeps the whole policy line in the body and no short form in the foot (foot at 507), as in rounds 4 and 5.
- Three- and four-piece bags now show their total. Today it appears only inside the button.

keep:
The 360x640 first screen exactly as it is:
- the worn hero at object-position 50% 100%;
- the Cormorant 27 H1;
- ₹2,399 at 24 with the grey strike and 'incl. GST';
- the material at the row's end;
- the ruled ladder in rupees;
- the one-line delivery and COD line with the date in 500;
- the opaque ivory bar with one ink primary carrying the price.

The type system and palette discipline:
- five Cormorant sizes at 500 with lining figures, four Jost sizes, no half pixels;
- ink, ivory, deep sage and the hairlines;
- radius 0 except the bag's checkout;
- no stars, badges, timers or marquee.
